# Why: the repository had no line-ending policy, so checkout behaviour depended
# on each machine's core.autocrlf. Files committed as LF were checked out as
# CRLF on Windows, which broke contract tests that match on "\n" — they passed
# in a working tree that predated the conversion and failed on any fresh clone.
# Pinning eol=lf makes every checkout match what is stored, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The only binary content tracked here. Declared explicitly so no future
# text=auto misdetection can corrupt it.
*.png binary
